==> Step 1: Detecting operating system...
[INFO] Detected: macos (brew)

=== Dry Run Preview (work) ===

OS:       macos (brew)
Profile:  work

Homebrew: @HOME@/brew, this account's own

Would install:
  Brewfile: @ROOT@/packages/Brewfile.work (N packages)

Would skip:
  Self-updating apps (messaging, browsers, VPNs and others)
  The separate modern CLI tools install: Brewfile.work carries them

Would configure:
  Homebrew analytics off

Settings (environment, then @HOME@/.config/ns-bootstrap/settings, then the work default):
  NS_BOOTSTRAP_EXTRA_APPS=off (default)
  NS_BOOTSTRAP_DAILY_UPDATE=off (default)
  NS_BOOTSTRAP_DAILY_SCOPE=formulae (default)
  NS_BOOTSTRAP_BREWFILE_LOCAL= (default)
  HOMEBREW_NO_ANALYTICS=1 (default)
  NS_BOOTSTRAP_SECRETS_PROVIDER=none (default)
  NS_BOOTSTRAP_OP_VAULT=Personal (default)
  NS_BOOTSTRAP_OP_ACCOUNT= (default)
  NS_BOOTSTRAP_GIT_SIGNING=none (default)


Dotfiles (nothing of yours is moved or replaced; a file that changes is backed up first):
  ~/.zshrc: create it, holding only the ns-bootstrap block
  ~/.zprofile: create it, holding only the ns-bootstrap block
  ~/.vimrc: link to ns-bootstrap's
  ~/.inputrc: link to ns-bootstrap's
  ~/.gitignore_global: link to ns-bootstrap's
  ~/.tmux.conf: link to ns-bootstrap's
  ~/.config/starship.toml: link to ns-bootstrap's
  ~/.config/atuin/config.toml: link to ns-bootstrap's
  ~/.npmrc: copy ns-bootstrap's in, as yours to edit
  ~/.config/pip/pip.conf: copy ns-bootstrap's in, as yours to edit

Set both by ns-bootstrap and by shell files already here (names only, never values):
  none found
  (Search paths such as PATH add up and are not listed; oh-my-zsh's own aliases are not checked.)


Git identity: the work name and email (and signing, if chosen) go in
  ~/.config/ns-bootstrap/gitconfig, included from ~/.config/git/config.
  ~/.gitconfig is left alone and read after it, so whatever it sets wins.

Git hooks: ns-bootstrap's, in ~/.config/git/hooks, set in ~/.config/git/config;
  each repository's own hooks and Git LFS's run too (ns-bootstrap.chainRepoHooks).
Daily update agent: off (scope: formulae)

No changes were made.
